       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI60900.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI60900.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Lista Extratos por reconciliar
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI60900         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV6090.
       COPY SWCV6091.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SW-SWITCH.
           05 SW-CURSOR                    PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-NONE                      VALUE '0'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-1                         VALUE '1'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-2                         VALUE '2'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-3                         VALUE '3'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-4                         VALUE '3'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5808                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5808'.
           05 CON-PENDENTE                 PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-DEBITO                   PIC  X(01) VALUE 'D'.
           05 CON-DATA-MAXIMA              PIC S9(08) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE +99991231.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-CSEND                     PIC  X(12) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CSEND.
              10 WS-C2COD-CBAN             PIC  X(04).
              10 WS-C2COD-CSPAI            PIC  X(02).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(06).

           05 WS-CCONTA                    PIC  X(20) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CCONTA.
              10 WS-CCOD-NCCCBALC          PIC  9(04).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-CCOD-NCCCCCB           PIC  X(13).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(02).

           05 WS-MONTANTE                  PIC  ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ9,99.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI60900'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

       01  WS-CURSOR-VARS.
           05 WS-MVALOR-MIN                PIC S9(16)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05 WS-MVALOR-MAX                PIC S9(16)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05 WS-DATVAL-MIN                PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-DATVAL-MAX                PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE 0.

           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CURSWT01 CURSOR FOR
                 SELECT
                       COSN
                     , COSNC
                     , CREF
                     , CREFOPR
                     , CREFEXT
                     , DATVAL
                     , MVALOR
                     , CDBCR
                 FROM SWVT5808
                 WHERE  CBAN      = :SWCD5808-CBAN
                   AND  CSPAI     = :SWCD5808-CSPAI
                   AND  CMOED     = :SWCD5808-CMOED
                   AND  CCODEST   = :SWCD5808-CCODEST
                   AND  MVALOR    BETWEEN :WS-MVALOR-MIN
                                      AND :WS-MVALOR-MAX
                   AND  DATVAL    BETWEEN :WS-DATVAL-MIN
                                      AND :WS-DATVAL-MAX
      * PAGINACAO
                   AND (COSN     >  :SWCD5808-COSN

                   OR   COSN     =  :SWCD5808-COSN
                   AND  COSNC    >= :SWCD5808-COSNC )

                 ORDER
                    BY COSN
                     , COSNC
           END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI60900         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0004.

            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.

           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV6090-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6090-ASE               TO SWCV6091-ASE.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV6091-INDICE.
           PERFORM 1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
              THRU 1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL SWCV6091-PAGINA-CHEIA.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1100-LIMPA-OCCURS.

           ADD 1                           TO SWCV6091-INDICE.
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV6091-D-COSN(SWCV6091-INDICE).
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV6091-D-COSNC(SWCV6091-INDICE).
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV6091-D-CREF(SWCV6091-INDICE).
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV6091-D-CREFOPR(SWCV6091-INDICE).
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV6091-D-CREFEXT(SWCV6091-INDICE).
           MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
             TO SWCV6091-D-DATAOPE(SWCV6091-INDICE).
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV6091-D-MVALOR(SWCV6091-INDICE).

       1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6090-NOMEFXLS          TO SWCV6091-NOMEFXLS
           MOVE SWCV6090-NMAXLIST          TO SWCV6091-NMAXLIST

           MOVE SWCV6090-COSN-PAG          TO SWCV6091-COSN-PAG
           MOVE SWCV6090-COSNC-PAG         TO SWCV6091-COSNC-PAG

           MOVE SWCV6090-IDRECON           TO SWCV6091-IDRECON
           MOVE SWCV6090-CSEND             TO SWCV6091-CSEND
           MOVE SWCV6090-CCONTA            TO SWCV6091-CCONTA
           MOVE SWCV6090-CMOED             TO SWCV6091-CMOED
           MOVE SWCV6090-MVALOR            TO SWCV6091-MVALOR
           MOVE SWCV6090-DDATAI            TO SWCV6091-DDATAI
           MOVE SWCV6090-DDATAF            TO SWCV6091-DDATAF

           PERFORM 2010-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2020-OPEN
                 THRU 2029-OPEN-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2030-FETCH
                 THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT

              IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 IF DB2-OK
                    PERFORM 2040-CONTINUA
                       THRU 2049-CONTINUA-EXIT
                 ELSE
                    COMPUTE SWCV6091-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV6091-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV6091-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV6091-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV6091-LENGTH
                         - SWCV6091-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV6091-IDRECON-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
                                           TO SWCV6091-IDRECON-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC   TO SWCV6091-IDRECON-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 2070-CLOSE
                 THRU 2079-CLOSE-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2010-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2010-VALIDACOES.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2010-VALIDACOES'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2020-OPEN
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2020-OPEN.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2020-OPEN'             TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2021-INI-CURSOR
              THRU 2021-INI-CURSOR-EXIT.

           SET SW-CURSOR-NONE TO TRUE

           IF SW-CURSOR-NONE
              SET SW-CURSOR-1 TO TRUE
           END-IF

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        OPEN CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.


       2029-OPEN-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2021-INI-CURSOR
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2021-INI-CURSOR.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2021-INI-CURSOR'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE CON-PENDENTE               TO SWCD5808-CCODEST.

           MOVE SWCV6090-CSEND             TO WS-CSEND.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CBAN              TO SWCD5808-CBAN.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CSPAI             TO SWCD5808-CSPAI.
           MOVE SWCV6090-CMOED             TO SWCD5808-CMOED.

      * Paginacao: COSN COSNC
           MOVE SWCV6090-COSN-PAG          TO SWCD5808-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV6090-COSNC-PAG         TO SWCD5808-COSNC.

      * MVALOR
           IF SWCV6090-MVALOR EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE ALL '9'                 TO WS-MVALOR-MIN
              MULTIPLY WS-MVALOR-MIN BY -1
                                       GIVING WS-MVALOR-MIN
              MOVE ALL '9'                 TO WS-MVALOR-MAX
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV6090-MVALOR         TO WS-MVALOR-MIN
              MOVE SWCV6090-MVALOR         TO WS-MVALOR-MAX
           END-IF.

      * DATVAL
           MOVE SWCV6090-DDATAI            TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO WS-DATVAL-MIN.

           MOVE CON-DATA-MAXIMA            TO WS-DATVAL-MAX.
           IF SWCV6090-DDATAF NOT EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
              MOVE SWCV6090-DDATAF         TO AQCW0005-DTX10
              PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
                 THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT
              MOVE AQCW0005-DT98           TO WS-DATVAL-MAX
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2021-INI-CURSOR AAA'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID

              MOVE 'WS-MVALOR-MIN        ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM ( 1)
              MOVE  WS-MVALOR-MIN          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR( 1)
              MOVE 'WS-MVALOR-MAX        ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM ( 2)
              MOVE  WS-MVALOR-MAX          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR( 2)

              MOVE 'WS-DATVAL-MIN        ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM ( 3)
              MOVE  WS-DATVAL-MIN          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR( 3)
              MOVE 'WS-DATVAL-MAX        ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM ( 4)
              MOVE  WS-DATVAL-MAX          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR( 4)

              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2021-INI-CURSOR ZZZ'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID

              MOVE 'SWCD5808-COSN        ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM ( 1)
              MOVE  SWCD5808-COSN          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR( 1)
              MOVE 'SWCD5808-COSNC       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM ( 2)
              MOVE  SWCD5808-COSNC         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR( 2)

              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2021-INI-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2030-FETCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2030-FETCH.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2030-FETCH'            TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                       FETCH CURSWT01
                       INTO
                           :SWCD5808-COSN
                         , :SWCD5808-COSNC
                         , :SWCD5808-CREF
                         , :SWCD5808-CREFOPR
                         , :SWCD5808-CREFEXT
                         , :SWCD5808-DATVAL
                         , :SWCD5808-MVALOR
                         , :SWCD5808-CDBCR
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

      * DBG paginacao
           MOVE 'SQLCODE   '               TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
           MOVE  SQLCODE                   TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
           MOVE 'SWCV6090-COSN-PAG'        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
           MOVE  SWCV6090-COSN-PAG         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
           MOVE 'SWCV6090-COSNC-PAG'       TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(3)
           MOVE  SWCV6090-COSNC-PAG        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(3)
           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT.

       2039-FETCH-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                       2040-CONTINUA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2040-CONTINUA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2040-CONTINUA'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV6091-INDICE.
           PERFORM 2050-TRATA-OCCURS
              THRU 2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL DB2-NOTFND
                OR SWCV6091-PAGINA-CHEIA
                OR NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT SWCV6091-PAGINA-CHEIA
                    COMPUTE SWCV6091-INDICE-INVERSO EQUAL
                         SWCV6091-INDICE-INVERSO - SWCV6091-INDICE
                    COMPUTE SWCV6091-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV6091-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV6091-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV6091-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV6091-LENGTH -
                         SWCV6091-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2049-CONTINUA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2050-TRATA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2050-TRATA-OCCURS.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2050-TRATA-OCCURS'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              ADD 1                        TO SWCV6091-INDICE

              MOVE SWCD5808-COSN
                TO SWCV6091-D-COSN(SWCV6091-INDICE)
              MOVE SWCD5808-COSNC
                TO SWCV6091-D-COSNC(SWCV6091-INDICE)
              MOVE SWCD5808-CREF
                TO SWCV6091-D-CREF(SWCV6091-INDICE)
              MOVE SWCD5808-CREFOPR
                TO SWCV6091-D-CREFOPR(SWCV6091-INDICE)
              MOVE SWCD5808-CREFEXT
                TO SWCV6091-D-CREFEXT(SWCV6091-INDICE)

              MOVE SWCD5808-DATVAL         TO AQCW0005-DT98
              PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                 THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
              MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10
                TO SWCV6091-D-DATAOPE(SWCV6091-INDICE)

              IF SWCD5808-CDBCR EQUAL CON-DEBITO
                 MULTIPLY SWCD5808-MVALOR BY -1 GIVING SWCD5808-MVALOR
              END-IF
              MOVE SWCD5808-MVALOR
                TO SWCV6091-D-MVALOR(SWCV6091-INDICE)
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2030-FETCH
              THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT.

       2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2070-CLOSE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2070-CLOSE.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2070-CLOSE'            TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        CLOSE CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

       2079-CLOSE-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF SWCV6090-NMAXLIST EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE VIAL0001-CAPLIC         TO ARCL0039-CAPLIC
              MOVE VIAL0001-COPCAO         TO ARCL0039-COPCAO
              PERFORM ARCR0039-NMAXLIST
                 THRU ARCR0039-NMAXLIST-EXIT

              IF ETCL0002-ABEND-DB2
                 MOVE ETCL0002-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE ETCL0002-SQLCA       TO VIAL0002-SQLCA
              END-IF

              MOVE ARCL0039-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV6091-NMAXLIST
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV6090-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV6091-NMAXLIST
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6091-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV6091-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6091-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE SWCV6091-INDICE            TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
